{"id":"m2://rec/open_logic/content/first-order-logic/natural-deduction/proving-things.tex#prob-2#1","source":"open_logic","snapshot":"blake3:a5eb116529d3e799289dd9f7e7530d0d446b3615f5608fe08c668241eee3c765","locator":"https://github.com/OpenLogicProject/OpenLogic/blob/1e960beff9ed7835bf3e3f1335e21af3439cd107/content/first-order-logic/natural-deduction/proving-things.tex#L277","native_id":"content/first-order-logic/natural-deduction/proving-things.tex#prob-2","kind":"exercise","text":"Give !!{derivation}s that show the following:\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $(!A \\lor !B) \\lif !C \\Proves !A \\lif !C$.\n\\item $(!A \\lif !C) \\land (!B \\lif !C) \\Proves (!A \\lor !B) \\lif !C$.\n\\item $\\Proves \\lnot(!A \\land \\lnot !A)$.\n\\item $!B \\lif !A \\Proves \\lnot !A \\lif \\lnot !B$.\n\\item $\\Proves (!A \\lif \\lnot !A) \\lif \\lnot !A$.\n\\item $\\Proves \\lnot(!A \\lif !B) \\lif \\lnot !B$.\n\\item $!A \\lif !C \\Proves \\lnot (!A \\land \\lnot !C)$.\n\\item $!A \\land \\lnot !C \\Proves \\lnot (!A \\lif !C)$.\n\\item $!A \\lor !B, \\lnot !B \\Proves !A$.\n\\item $\\lnot !A \\lor \\lnot !B \\Proves \\lnot(!A \\land !B)$.\n\\item $\\Proves (\\lnot !A \\land \\lnot !B) \\lif\\lnot(!A \\lor !B)$.\n\\item $\\Proves \\lnot(!A \\lor !B) \\lif (\\lnot !A \\land \\lnot !B)$.\n\\end{enumerate}","class":"open","by":"textbook/1","resource":"PKGMM3P5QY","at":{"section":"15.7","kind":"prob"}}
